{
  "_comment": "Hand-maintained map from docker / docker compose / docker swarm CLI commands to the provider type and attributes that do the same job. tools/genskill renders .claude/skills/docker-cli-map/SKILL.md from it plus tools/parity/paritydata, and fails (also under -check) when a type or attribute named here does not exist in the provider schema. Each command has either `map` (kind: resource | data | action | ephemeral | list | function | provider | tool; attrs are dotted paths into the schema, for a function its parameter names, for a tool a path in the repo) or `none` (why there is no equivalent; start it with BLOCKED: when the Engine API or framework cannot do it). Keep groups in order: docker, compose, swarm.",
  "commands": [
    {"cli": "docker run", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["image", "name", "command", "env", "ports", "mounts", "restart", "state"]}], "note": "A long-running `docker run -d` is a docker_container (`state = \"running\"`, the default). A one-shot run kept for inspection is a docker_container with `state = \"exited\"`; run-and-remove is the docker_container_run action (`docker run --rm`)."},
    {"cli": "docker run --rm", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_run", "attrs": ["image", "command", "env", "remove", "timeout", "expected_exit_codes", "result_path"]}], "note": "Creates, starts, waits for the exit, captures exit_code / stdout / stderr, then removes the container. For a one-shot container kept in state use docker_container with `state = \"exited\"`."},
    {"cli": "docker create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["state"]}], "note": "`state = \"created\"` creates the container and never starts it."},
    {"cli": "docker start / docker stop", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["state"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_start", "attrs": ["container_id"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_stop", "attrs": ["container_id", "signal", "timeout"]}], "note": "`state` is the desired state (`running` starts a stopped container in place; `created` never starts it); the actions start or stop a container once without changing configuration."},
    {"cli": "docker restart", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_restart", "attrs": ["container_id", "timeout"]}], "note": "For Swarm services use the docker_service_force_update action."},
    {"cli": "docker rm", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": []}], "note": "Remove the resource from configuration, or `terraform destroy -target=docker_container.x`."},
    {"cli": "docker exec", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_exec", "attrs": ["container_id", "service_id", "command", "env", "user", "workdir", "detach", "tty", "stdin"]}, {"kind": "ephemeral", "type": "docker_exec_output", "attrs": ["container_id", "command", "stdin"]}], "note": "Use the ephemeral resource when the command's stdout feeds other configuration. `docker exec -i` piping input is `stdin` (written, then closed); `stdin` on the action shows in plans (actions cannot mark attributes sensitive), on the ephemeral resource it is sensitive."},
    {"cli": "docker cp (host to container)", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["files", "files.path", "files.content", "files.content_base64", "files.source"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_cp", "attrs": ["container_id", "path", "content", "source"]}], "note": "The `files` block writes files before the container's first start; the action copies into an existing container at any time."},
    {"cli": "docker cp (container to host)", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container_file", "attrs": ["container", "path"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_export", "attrs": ["container_id", "output"]}], "note": "The data source reads one file or directory as a tar; the export action writes the whole filesystem as a tar."},
    {"cli": "docker logs", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container_logs", "attrs": ["container", "tail", "since"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker ps / docker container ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_containers", "attrs": ["all", "name", "status"]}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker inspect / docker container inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker diff", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container_changes", "attrs": ["container"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker stats --no-stream", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container_stats", "attrs": ["container"]}], "note": "One sample per read; there is no live stream."},
    {"cli": "docker top", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_container_top", "attrs": ["container", "ps_args"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker system df", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_system_df", "attrs": ["verbose"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker events", "group": "docker", "none": "No equivalent: a live event stream is not Terraform state."},
    {"cli": "docker export", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_export", "attrs": ["container_id", "output"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker commit", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_image_commit", "attrs": ["container_id", "reference", "changes"]}], "note": "Snapshots are not declarative; prefer building the image with docker_image from a Dockerfile."},
    {"cli": "docker update", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["memory", "cpu_shares", "restart"]}], "note": "Changes to resource limits are applied by the resource; some force replacement (see the reference)."},
    {"cli": "docker rename", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_container", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker pause / docker unpause", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_pause", "attrs": ["container_id"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_unpause", "attrs": ["container_id"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker kill", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_kill", "attrs": ["container_id", "signal"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker wait", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_wait", "attrs": ["container_id", "condition"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker attach", "group": "docker", "none": "No equivalent: an interactive stream is not managed state. Use docker_exec for one-off commands."},
    {"cli": "docker container prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_container_prune", "attrs": ["filters"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker pull", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": ["name", "keep_locally"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker build", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": ["name", "build", "build.context", "build.dockerfile", "build.builder"]}], "note": "`build.builder = \"buildkit\"` for BuildKit features (secrets, cache_from, platforms)."},
    {"cli": "docker buildx build", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": ["build.builder", "build.platforms", "build.secrets", "build.outputs", "build.cache_to", "build.attestations"]}], "note": "`build.builder` names a docker_buildx_builder, or `buildkit` for the daemon's own BuildKit."},
    {"cli": "docker buildx create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_buildx_builder", "attrs": ["name", "node", "append", "driver", "platform", "buildkitd_flags", "buildkitd_config", "docker_container"]}], "note": "docker-container driver only; the buildx instance list is BLOCKED (buildx-private local state)."},
    {"cli": "docker buildx bake", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_buildx_bake", "attrs": ["files", "targets", "builder"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_buildx_builder", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_buildx_builders", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx history ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_buildx_history_records", "attrs": ["builder", "limit"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx history inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_buildx_history", "attrs": ["builder", "ref"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx du", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_buildx_disk_usage", "attrs": ["builder"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker builder prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_builder_prune", "attrs": ["all", "filters", "keep_storage"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_builder_prune", "attrs": ["builder", "all", "filters"]}], "note": "Set `builder` to prune a docker_buildx_builder's cache."},
    {"cli": "docker buildx imagetools create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_registry_manifest_list", "attrs": ["name", "manifests"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker buildx imagetools inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_registry_image_manifests", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker tag", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_tag", "attrs": ["source_image", "target_image"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker push", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_registry_image", "attrs": ["name", "keep_remotely"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker rmi", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": ["keep_locally"]}], "note": "Destroying a docker_image removes it unless `keep_locally = true`."},
    {"cli": "docker images / docker image ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_images", "attrs": ["reference", "dangling", "labels"]}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker image inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_image", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker image history", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_image_history", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker search", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_image_search", "attrs": ["term", "limit"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker save", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_image_save", "attrs": ["images", "output"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker load", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_image_load", "attrs": ["input"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker import", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_image_import", "attrs": ["source", "repository", "tag"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker image prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_image_prune", "attrs": ["dangling", "filters"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker system prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_system_prune", "attrs": ["containers", "images", "volumes", "networks", "build_cache"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker network create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_network", "attrs": ["name", "driver"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker network ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_networks", "attrs": ["name", "driver"]}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_network", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker network inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_network", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker network prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_network_prune", "attrs": ["filters"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker volume create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_volume", "attrs": ["name", "driver"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker volume create --type mount|block (cluster volume)", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_volume", "attrs": ["name", "driver", "cluster_volume_spec", "cluster_volume_spec.access_mode"]}], "note": "Swarm CSI volumes; the provider must point at a manager."},
    {"cli": "docker volume update --availability", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_volume", "attrs": ["cluster_volume_spec.availability"]}], "note": "Updated in place."},
    {"cli": "docker volume ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_volumes", "attrs": ["name", "driver"]}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_volume", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker volume inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_volume", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker volume prune", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_volume_prune", "attrs": ["all", "filters"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker login", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "provider", "type": "docker", "attrs": ["registry_auth", "registry_auth.address", "registry_auth.username", "registry_auth.password", "allow_credential_helpers"]}, {"kind": "ephemeral", "type": "docker_registry_login", "attrs": ["server_address", "username", "password"]}, {"kind": "ephemeral", "type": "docker_registry_token", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker context use / docker -H", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "provider", "type": "docker", "attrs": ["context", "host", "ssh", "cert_path"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker info / docker system info", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_info", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker version", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_version", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker plugin install", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_plugin", "attrs": ["name", "enabled", "grant_all_permissions"]}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_plugin", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker plugin ls", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_plugins", "attrs": ["enabled", "capability"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker plugin create", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_plugin_create", "attrs": ["name", "context_dir"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker plugin push", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_plugin_push", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker plugin upgrade", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_plugin", "attrs": ["name", "alias"]}], "note": "Changing `name` with `alias` set upgrades the plugin in place."},
    {"cli": "docker manifest inspect", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_registry_image_manifests", "attrs": ["name"]}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_registry_image", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker manifest create / annotate / push", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_registry_manifest_list", "attrs": ["name", "manifests", "annotations"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker manifest rm", "group": "docker", "none": "No equivalent: the CLI's manifest list draft is local state. Destroying docker_registry_manifest_list deletes the registry tag unless `keep_remotely = true`."},
    {"cli": "registry tag listing (crane ls / skopeo list-tags)", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_registry_image_tags", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "image reference parsing", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "function", "type": "parse_image_ref", "attrs": ["ref"]}, {"kind": "function", "type": "image_ref", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker port / -p parsing", "group": "docker", "map": [{"kind": "function", "type": "port_spec", "attrs": []}]},

    {"cli": "docker compose up", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_compose", "attrs": ["content", "files", "name", "profiles", "env", "mode", "remove_orphans"]}], "note": "Or convert once to plain resources with tools/compose2stack."},
    {"cli": "docker compose down", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_compose", "attrs": ["keep_volumes"]}], "note": "Destroy the docker_compose resource."},
    {"cli": "docker compose config", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_config", "attrs": ["content", "files"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose convert", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "tool", "type": "tools/compose2stack", "attrs": []}], "note": "`go run ./tools/compose2stack -in docker-compose.yml -out stack.tf -mode swarm|local`."},
    {"cli": "docker compose ps", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_containers", "attrs": ["name", "all"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose ls", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_projects", "attrs": ["all"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose volumes", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_volumes", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose images", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_images", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose exec", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_exec", "attrs": ["name", "service", "command"]}, {"kind": "action", "type": "docker_exec", "attrs": ["container_id"]}], "note": "Local-mode container names are `<project>-<service>-<n>`."},
    {"cli": "docker compose logs", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_logs", "attrs": ["name", "services", "tail", "since"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose port", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_port", "attrs": ["name", "service", "private_port"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose top", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_compose_top", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose pull", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_pull", "attrs": ["content", "files"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose push", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_push", "attrs": ["content", "files", "ignore_missing"]}], "note": "`--ignore-missing` is `ignore_missing`."},
    {"cli": "docker compose up --scale", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_compose", "attrs": ["content"]}], "note": "Set `deploy.replicas` in the compose content."},
    {"cli": "docker compose scale", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_scale", "attrs": ["replicas"]}], "note": "The action does not change configuration; set `deploy.replicas` in the compose content to keep a size."},
    {"cli": "docker compose build", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_build", "attrs": ["content", "files", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose run", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_run", "attrs": ["service", "command", "start_dependencies", "no_recreate"]}], "note": "Dependencies are not started unless `start_dependencies = true` (docker_compose normally owns them, as with `--no-deps`); `--no-recreate` is `no_recreate`."},
    {"cli": "docker compose watch / alpha", "group": "compose", "none": "No equivalent: file watching and experimental commands are not declarative."},
    {"cli": "docker compose start", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_start", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose stop", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_stop", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose restart", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_restart", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose kill", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_kill", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose pause", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_pause", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose unpause", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_unpause", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose wait", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_wait", "attrs": ["name", "services"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose commit", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_commit", "attrs": ["service", "repository"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose cp", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_cp", "attrs": ["service", "direction", "container_path", "local_path"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose export", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_export", "attrs": ["service", "output"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker compose publish", "group": "compose", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_compose_publish", "attrs": ["repository"]}]},

    {"cli": "docker swarm init", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_init", "attrs": ["advertise_addr", "autolock"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm join", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_node", "attrs": ["host", "join_token", "role", "ssh"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm join-token", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_swarm_tokens", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "ephemeral", "type": "docker_swarm_tokens", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm join-token --rotate", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_swarm_rotate_tokens", "attrs": ["worker", "manager"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm unlock-key / update --autolock", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_init", "attrs": ["autolock", "unlock_key"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm unlock-key --rotate", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_swarm_rotate_unlock_key", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm update", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_init", "attrs": ["labels", "autolock", "orchestration", "raft", "dispatcher", "ca_config"]}], "note": "Updated in place."},
    {"cli": "docker swarm ca --rotate", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_swarm_rotate_ca", "attrs": ["signing_ca_cert", "signing_ca_key"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker swarm leave", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_node", "attrs": []}], "note": "Destroying docker_swarm_node leaves and removes the node."},
    {"cli": "docker swarm unlock", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_swarm_unlock", "attrs": ["unlock_key"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker info (Swarm section)", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_swarm", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker node ls / inspect", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_nodes", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_swarm_node", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker node update --availability drain", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_node_drain", "attrs": ["node_id"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": ["availability"]}], "note": "The action is for a one-off drain (it waits for tasks to leave); the attribute for the desired state."},
    {"cli": "docker node update --availability active", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_node_activate", "attrs": ["node_id"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": ["availability"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker node update --label-add / --availability / --role", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": ["node_id", "labels", "availability", "role"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker node promote", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_node_promote", "attrs": ["node_id"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": ["role"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker node demote", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_node_demote", "attrs": ["node_id"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_node", "attrs": ["role"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker node rm", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_swarm_node", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker service create / update", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_service", "attrs": ["name", "image", "replicas", "env", "networks"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker service scale", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_service_scale", "attrs": ["service_id", "replicas"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_service", "attrs": ["replicas"]}], "note": "The action does not change configuration; the next apply restores `replicas`."},
    {"cli": "docker service update --force", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_service_force_update", "attrs": ["service_id"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker service rollback", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "action", "type": "docker_service_rollback", "attrs": ["service_id"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker service ls / inspect", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_services", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_service", "attrs": ["name"]}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_service", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker service ps / docker node ps", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_tasks", "attrs": ["service_id", "node_id", "desired_state"]}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_task", "attrs": ["id"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker service logs", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_service_logs", "attrs": ["service_id", "tail", "since"]}, {"kind": "data", "type": "docker_task_logs", "attrs": ["task_id", "tail", "since"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker service rm", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_service", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker stack deploy", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_stack", "attrs": ["name", "service"]}, {"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_compose", "attrs": ["mode"]}], "note": "docker_compose with `mode = \"swarm\"` takes the compose file directly."},
    {"cli": "docker stack rm", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_stack", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker stack ls", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_stacks", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker stack services", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_stack", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker stack ps", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_tasks", "attrs": ["labels"]}], "note": "Filter on the stack label: `labels = { \"com.docker.stack.namespace\" = \"<stack>\" }`."},
    {"cli": "docker secret create", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_secret", "attrs": ["name", "data", "data_wo", "data_wo_version"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker secret ls", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_secrets", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_secret", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker secret inspect", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_secret", "attrs": ["name"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker config create", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "resource", "type": "docker_config", "attrs": ["name", "data", "data_wo"]}]},
    {"cli": "docker config ls", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_configs", "attrs": []}, {"kind": "list", "type": "docker_config", "attrs": []}]},
    {"cli": "docker config inspect", "group": "swarm", "map": [{"kind": "data", "type": "docker_config", "attrs": ["name"]}]}
  ]
}
